<<KieranDominicBargeIn>>
CRACK!
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The door bursts open as two men barge in. One is tall and broad-shouldered, his satin black suit catching the light, a red silk tie hanging loose from his unbuttoned collar. Spurs jingle as he steps forward, his black aviators reflecting your startled face.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The other, leaner and equally pale, sweeps the room with a pistol in hand. His stance is sharp, but there's tension in his movements; a gold pendant glints against his sweater as he turns.][/nomarkup]
{$sheriff}: Hello ma'am, we know you are in here somewhere...
{$sheriff}: Reckon it smells like somebody's been real busy in here.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He has an audible Texan accent.][/nomarkup]
{$kieran}: There is no point in hiding, miss Bardot. This is not a conversation that you wish to delay. #line:0518162
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Rationality evades you, fury boils in your blood.][/nomarkup]
{$beast}: [nomarkup][Who are they to barge into your home like this? Show them some manners.][/nomarkup] #line:025adfd 
