        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He's clearly unbothered. Amused, even. He grins menacingly, looking you up and down as his hand snatches the crowbar and pulls it from your hands. Without taking his eyes off you, he tosses it away from your reach.][/nomarkup] #line:06e97a8 
    <<else>>
        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Barely moving, he nonchalantly dodges your attack with his hand in his pocket.][/nomarkup] #failure
        {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He's clearly unbothered. Amused, even. He grins menacingly, looking you up and down as his hand snatches the crowbar and pulls it from your hands. Without taking his eyes off you, he tosses it away from your reach.][/nomarkup]
    <<endif>>
