-> [nomarkup][Drop your weapon.][/nomarkup] <<if $gotweapon == true>> #line:0bbfd00 
    {$sheriff}: Sharp. #line:01ea142 
-> [nomarkup][Run.][/nomarkup] #line:0ef42d5 
    [nomarkup][Before you have the chance to even take a step, he moves with inhuman speed to block your exit.][/nomarkup] #line:0b4ff3e 
{$sheriff}: Heh, you sure know how to make an impression - I'll give you that. #line:07a7163 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Imposing. The man pulls out a cigarette and lights it, the flickering flame produced by the zippo lighter in his hand reflected by his sunglasses. The small flame is close enough to make you recoil instinctively.][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He taps the ash from his cigarette in your sink.][/nomarkup]
{$sheriff}: I'm gonna be straight with ya - you ain't walkin' away from this. I'm just debatin' whether to do it now... or haul you off and let the missus decide.
{$sheriff}: [nomarkup][He falls silent for a second, allowing himself to breathe in another dose of thick, tar-laden smoke from his cigarette.][/nomarkup]  #line:0ac98e8 
{$sheriff}: How about this, tell me where your sire's hidin' and I'll make it quick.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Your sire? What is he talking about?][/nomarkup]
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He waits expectantly for your response.][/nomarkup]
-> {$pcName}: [nomarkup][I need to bide my time.][/nomarkup] #line:0712ce8
