title: SireInfo
tags:
---
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][One question in particular sticks out to you the most.][/nomarkup]
-> {$pcName}: What did you mean by sire?
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Both men seem a little stunned by your question. They scan you up and down searching for something.][/nomarkup] #line:0f6a534
{$sheriff}: You don't know, do ya?
{$kieran}: Confusion is to be expected, given the nature of your...
{$kieran}: Predicament. #line:04357d2
{$sheriff}: They sure did ya dirty, didn't they? Hate to be the one tellin' you this, but your sire's the one that turned you into a vampire. #line:0d32d70
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][You're sure you must have misunderstood.][/nomarkup]
{$pcName}: A vampire?
{$sheriff}: Yes ma'am, you heard me right. You're one of us now.
{$kieran}: 'Kindred' is the term we use in sophisticated circles. #line:015f79e
{$sheriff}: Not that it matters to ya now, but at least you know you didn't kill for nothin'. #line:00482a8
{$sheriff}: You were just hungry.
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][The crazy part is that it makes some amount of sense. Not that it makes you feel any better.][/nomarkup] #line:0d0fe7d
<<jump AnyOtherQuestions>>
