title: WhoAreYou
tags:
---
{$sheriff}: Aw, my bad. Wouldn't wanna be rude. Name's Dominic. I'm the Sheriff 'round here, but don't get it twisted - I ain't no pig. Just the closest thing us Kindred got to law in these parts. Sourface here? That's Kieran. He's a bit shy.
{$kieran}: I can introduce myself. #line:00c1a47 
{$sheriff}: Sure you can. #line:0d2b8f2 
{$storyteller}: [nomarkup][Kieran sighs, glaring tired daggers at Dominic.][/nomarkup] #line:091e88b  
